12: </head>
12: <body>
12:   <header>
12:     <h1><span>🛰️</span> ATAS MOO v2.0.0 — MONITOR & AUDITORIA EM MALHA FECHADA</h1>
12:     <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center;">
